m{ComplexAtlas}_S(\\mathcal B,M,\\tau,n)\\land\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\mathcal B\\to\\mathcal B=\\mathcal A\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}complex\\text{-}structure} \\vdash \\mathrm{ComplexStructure}_S(\\mathcal A,M,\\tau,n)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ComplexAtlas}_S(\\mathcal A,M,\\tau,n)\\land\\forall\\mathcal B\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{ComplexAtlas}_S(\\mathcal B,M,\\tau,n)\\land\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\mathcal B\\to\\mathcal B=\\mathcal A\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>本原子采用“极大兼容复图册”作为复结构；其所有结构参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(M,\\tau,n)\">\\((M,\\tau,n)\\)</span> 均显式出现。</li>\n<li>切丛自同态 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\">\\(J\\)</span> 的可积几乎复结构是等价刻画，但需要另行形式化切丛、Lie 括号与 Nijenhuis 张量，不能用无来源的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Integrable}_S(J)\">\\(\\mathrm{Integrable}_S(J)\\)</span> 代替。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-complex-manifold","status":"resolved","id":"0ab38aca0c5161bb","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-complex-manifold]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-complex-manifold","status":"resolved","id":"0ab38aca0c5161bb","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ComplexAtlas}_S\\subseteq V^4$ (复图册谓词, see [[58-df-complex-manifold]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ComplexAtlas}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ComplexStructure}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}complex\\text{-}structure} \\vdash \\mathrm{ComplexStructure}_S(\\mathcal A,M,\\tau,n)\\lef